{"title": "对话人物：", "index": 423, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre2\" id=\"B4LIC0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">\n<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"chapter\">\n<div class=\"calibre3\" id=\"calibre_pb_0\"></div><h1 class=\"kindle-cn-heading14\" id=\"calibre_pb_1\"><a class=\"calibre17\" id=\"page1\"></a>对话人物：</h1>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><span>苏格拉底（Socrates）</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><span>格劳孔（Glaucon）</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><span>阿德曼图斯（Adeimantus）</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><span>玻勒马霍斯（Polemarchus）</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><span>克法洛斯（Cephalus）</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><span>塞拉西马柯（Thrasymachus）</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><span>克里托芬（Cleitophon）</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre4\"><span>其他</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}